#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify by hand a dictionary of measurement outcomes:\n"
msgstr "Nyatakan secara manual kamus hasil pengukuran:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transform the counts `dict` into a bitstring matrix and probability array for post-processing:\n"
msgstr "Ubah `dict` kiraan kepada matriks rentetan bit dan tatasusunan kebarangkalian untuk pasca-pemprosesan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Subsample a single batch of size two:\n"
msgstr "Subsampel satu kelompok bersaiz dua:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``n_batches = 1``: Number of batches of configurations used by the different calls to the eigenstate solver\n"
msgstr "``n_batches = 1``: Bilangan kelompok konfigurasi yang digunakan oleh panggilan berbeza kepada penyelesai keadaan eigen\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``samples_per_batch = 2``: Number of unique configurations to include in each batch\n"
msgstr "``samples_per_batch = 2``: Bilangan konfigurasi unik yang disertakan dalam setiap kelompok\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Obtain decimal representation of the spin-up and spin-down bitstrings used by the eigenstate solver.\n"
msgstr "Dapatkan perwakilan perpuluhan bagi rentetan bit spin-atas dan spin-bawah yang digunakan oleh penyelesai keadaan eigen.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The first element in the tuple corresponds to the decimal representation of the spin-up configurations, while the second element in the tuple corresponds to the decimal representation of the spin-down configurations:\n"
msgstr "Unsur pertama dalam tupel sepadan dengan perwakilan perpuluhan bagi konfigurasi spin-atas, manakala unsur kedua dalam tupel sepadan dengan perwakilan perpuluhan bagi konfigurasi spin-bawah:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that while the number of samples per batch is two, and the sampled bitstrings are: $00010010$ and $01001000$, four electronic configurations are generated per spin-species. In this case, the set of unique spin-polarized configurations is given by:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{U} = \\{ 0001, 0010, 0100, 1000 \\}\n"
"$$\n"
"whose base-10 decimal representation is\n"
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{U}_{10} = \\{ 1, 2, 4, 8 \\}\n"
"$$\n"
"Basis of the subspace:\n"
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahawa walaupun bilangan sampel setiap kelompok ialah dua, dan rentetan bit yang disampel ialah: $00010010$ dan $01001000$, empat konfigurasi elektronik dijana bagi setiap spesies spin. Dalam kes ini, set konfigurasi berkutub spin yang unik diberikan oleh:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{U} = \\{ 0001, 0010, 0100, 1000 \\}\n"
"$$\n"
"yang perwakilan perpuluhan asas-10nya ialah\n"
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{U}_{10} = \\{ 1, 2, 4, 8 \\}\n"
"$$\n"
"Asas subruang:\n"

